                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I thought it was very short, but it's all about replay and different choices. The choices are attributed to which work path you choose and where you choose to work. \n\nFeel free to travel as soon as the option arrives!\n\nSo far, I've done a few playthroughs, but on each, during the 'Love Choices', I am unable to 'sculpt' with the chisel. No interaction option appears. Other than that, the minigames for 'work' are fun, though I feel that the music minigames are more polished than programmer. \n\nPretty and fun to play through :)",
